---
const repo = 'https://github.com/0xHelico/helico'
const record = `${repo}/blob/main/docs/plans/2026-09-05-cre-forwarder-delivery.md`
const cards = [
	{ label: 'Never held', title: 'Your deposit stays in your wallet.', copy: 'The contract moves it for one step, and proves it kept none before that step ends.' },
	{ label: 'Never outside your rules', title: 'Break a rule and the move is refused.', copy: 'The contract checks every rule itself. 240+ automated checks run on every change.' },
	{ label: 'Nothing hidden', title: 'All of the code is public.', copy: 'Twelve automated reviewers went over it. That is not a professional audit, and nothing is live yet.' },
]
---

<section class="wrap" id="verified" aria-labelledby="verified-title">
	<div class="section-card center">
		<span class="eyebrow">Helico</span>
		<h2 class="headline" id="verified-title">Your Money Stays Yours</h2>
		<p class="lede">It can move your deposit. It can never keep it.</p>
		<div class="cards" style="text-align:left">
			{cards.map((c) => (
				<div class="card">
					<span class="label">{c.label}</span>
					<h3>{c.title}</h3>
					<p>{c.copy}</p>
				</div>
			))}
		</div>

		<div class="split">
			<div>
				<h3>94% kept working.</h3>
				<p>In a rehearsal on a copy of the real market, a deposit that had drifted out of its band was moved back with 94% of it still working. The rules asked for at least 50%. A rehearsal, not the live network.</p>
			</div>
			<a class="btn btn--secondary" href={record}>See the Record</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.cards {
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}
</style>
